Title:          Dr. Mind (Lite)
Description:    Dr. Mind is a PC adaptation of the Mastermind (TM) board game. The Lite version does not include images.
Summary:        Dr. Mind is a PC adaptation of a well-known board game. The computer generates a secret color code, and the player has to figure out the exact pattern within 8 turns. After each turn, the computer provides clues about how many colors matched the solution. The game features a set of 24 pictures that are initially blured - every time you work out a valid code combination, you are rewarded with a picture. This game is published under the CC BY-ND 4.0 license, which is roughly equivalent to "freeware with source code". (packaged for FreeDOS)
Keywords:       mind,mastermind,games
End
